<title>CHINA: China April soy products import, export totals.</title>
<headline>China April soy products import, export totals.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of soybean, soymeal and soyoil as reported in official customs figures (percentage change for January-April 1997 compared with the same period last year):</p>
<p>		    APRIL	  JAN-APRIL IMPORTS	VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	120,910	   1,120,492		 N/A PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	  99,119	     402,555		  -14</p>
<p> Soymeal	 69,405	   1,142,227		 N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		    APRIL	  JAN-APRIL EXPORTS	VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	 23,985		88,588		 N/A PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	   7,276		 9,876		  +1,488</p>
<p> Soymeal	  9,424		11,494		 N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
